{"data": [{"id": "2122135564040188041", "author_id": "1561944908281581568", "text": "@ClementDelangue @yaelmendez But you did not create such scale value. Value is on top of concentration", "lang": "en", "created_at": "2026-11-16T01:12:00.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/conviction_bets/status/2122135564040188041", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122132737800995164", "author_id": "1570666855249084418", "text": "@ClementDelangue Google gave Android away for free and still locked up mobile through the app store. In banking, how does open source win if three big clouds still control compliance?", "lang": "en", "created_at": "2026-11-16T01:00:46.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/rayofolives/status/2122132737800995164", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122131504684003502", "author_id": "1215591979951763456", "text": "@ClementDelangue Dark Ages 2.0", "lang": "en", "created_at": "2026-11-16T00:55:52.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/ArtisScriptor/status/2122131504684003502", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122131128228450636", "author_id": "2106392864544768000", "text": "@ClementDelangue Open weights help. But they don't redistribute the chips, data centers or power contracts needed to train the next frontier model. Open source reduces one kind of dependence; it doesn't erase the infrastructure bottleneck.", "lang": "en", "created_at": "2026-11-16T00:54:22.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/ThamasLi/status/2122131128228450636", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122130397589041500", "author_id": "463854540", "text": "@ClementDelangue 100% behind what Hugging Face is doing to push open models forward though!", "lang": "en", "created_at": "2026-11-16T00:51:28.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/sirinnia/status/2122130397589041500", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122129724810076454", "author_id": "2879223463", "text": "@ClementDelangue Anthropic想成为地球上唯一的神,其他任何公司或个人都必须听命于Anthropic", "lang": "zh", "created_at": "2026-11-16T00:48:48.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/LeeMempp/status/2122129724810076454", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122129716048224580", "author_id": "463854540", "text": "@ClementDelangue Yes, but open source without accessible compute and electricity to actually train and run it won't cut it either, I’m afraid :(", "lang": "en", "created_at": "2026-11-16T00:48:46.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/sirinnia/status/2122129716048224580", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 16, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122129300614693099", "author_id": "1383929672161845248", "text": "@ClementDelangue @JinjingLiang You are very much correct about the danger of the concentration of power here. It is the choice between world that allows all to rise or a techno feudal world.", "lang": "en", "created_at": "2026-11-16T00:47:07.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/Publius_____/status/2122129300614693099", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 58, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122129217647489128", "author_id": "24997888", "text": "@ClementDelangue Fair point on the asymmetry risk, but how do we break the cycle from repeating? Teaching kids to reject this easy fast food option and critically think for themselves is probably the only way the next generation will change.", "lang": "en", "created_at": "2026-11-16T00:46:47.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/thetokyotrader/status/2122129217647489128", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 12, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122127614303142239", "author_id": "915765587682369537", "text": "@ClementDelangue Open weights help, but the check only works if people can actually afford to run and build on them — compute is where the concentration bites hardest. What do you think closes that gap faster: cheaper inference, or open training data?", "lang": "en", "created_at": "2026-11-16T00:40:25.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/ReignSwords/status/2122127614303142239", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122127112207212643", "author_id": "1995263938259460097", "text": "@ClementDelangue Agree. I am devastated I fell for the ideology... Yet, their strategic communication will soon backfire a lot. Claude cant handle everything... This bubble needs to be pop from the inside. Their claude shield with their communication is remarkable. Yet, the real infrastructure", "lang": "en", "created_at": "2026-11-16T00:38:25.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/balazskerek/status/2122127112207212643", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 77, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122127096419938460", "author_id": "1770129312244457472", "text": "@ClementDelangue concentration risk, now with stock options", "lang": "en", "created_at": "2026-11-16T00:38:21.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/ZeroClickz/status/2122127096419938460", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 24, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122126863392981034", "author_id": "1510028300", "text": "@ClementDelangue 开源确实能形成一定的制衡，但只靠它够不够，我心里还真没底。", "lang": "